    //     = (y+1) * sum_{i=0}^{x} i + (x+1) * y*(y+1)/2
    //     = (y+1) * x*(x+1)/2 + (x+1) * y*(y+1)/2
    //     = (x+1)(y+1)/2 * (x + y)

    // So bananas = (x+1)*(y+1)*(x+y)/2

    // We need to maximize this over all integer x >= 0, y >= 0 such that x + m*y <= m*b.

