        // Compute bananas = (x+1)*(y+1)*(x+y)/2
        // Be careful with overflow, but answer <= 10^18, and m <= 1000, b <= 10000
        // x can be up to m*b = 10^7, y up to 10^4
        // (x+1) ~ 10^7, (y+1) ~ 10^4, (x+y) ~ 10^7
